<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>OAuth Success - Calendar Copycat</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 50px auto;
      padding: 20px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    h1 { color: #2ecc71; }
    h2 { color: #34495e; margin-top: 30px; }
    pre {
      background: #f4f4f4;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }
    .info {
      background: #e8f5e9;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>✅ Authentication Successful!</h1>
  
  <div class="info">
    <p><strong>Account ID:</strong> <%= @account_id %></p>
    <p><strong>Email:</strong> <%= @email %></p>
  </div>

  <h2>📝 Step 1: Add this secret to Fly.io</h2>
  
  <p>Run this command in your terminal:</p>
  
  <pre>fly secrets set ACCOUNT_<%= @account_id.upcase %>_REFRESH_TOKEN="<%= @refresh_token %>"</pre>

  <h2>🚀 Step 2: Redeploy your app</h2>
  
  <p>After setting the secret, redeploy to activate the changes:</p>
  
  <pre>fly deploy</pre>

  <h2>⚠️ Important</h2>
  
  <ul>
    <li>Keep this refresh token secure - don't share it!</li>
    <li>You can close this page after setting the secret</li>
    <li>Repeat this process for each Google account you want to sync</li>
  </ul>

  <p><a href="/">← Back to home</a></p>
</body>
</html>
